# expect: 127
# expect: 69
# expect: 76
# expect: 70
# $buf->N arrow access: read element at constant index N. Same as
# [buf-get $buf N] but cleaner syntax. See BUFFER_DESIGN.md M3.
def [Buf 4 u8] magic [[Buf 4 u8] 0x7f 0x45 0x4c 0x46]
print $magic->0
print $magic->1
print $magic->2
print $magic->3
